<newsitem itemid="232597" id="root" date="1996-12-03" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Racal profits hit by 10 mln stg charge.</title>
<headline>Racal profits hit by 10 mln stg charge.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>6 months to October 11</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.78		   vs 7.09</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.10		   vs 2.10</p>
<p> Pretax		     21.2		   vs 30.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   602		    vs 501.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Racal Electronics Plc issued a profit warning on Monday stating that its half year pretax profit would be around 21 million stg. The figure was hit by a 10 million stg charge relating to the reorganisation of the Data Products unit.</p>
</text>
